x/tools@v0.50.0's own fixtures for buildtag, go/analysis/passes/buildtag/testdata, byte for byte. They are an
archive because most are files gofmt would rewrite, adding or changing build lines, and cohere's gofmt guard reads
every Go file under testdata.
-- src/a/buildtag.go --
